      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Transport from Kolkata Agartala</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
	<p>When transporting your vehicle from Kolkata to Agartala, it is crucial to have the right documents and insurance coverage. Here are the essential paperwork required:</p>

	<p>The Vehicle Registration Certificate (RC) is a crucial document as it serves as proof of ownership. A self-attested RC photocopy is necessary for car transport. Make sure the copy includes all relevant details, such as make, model, engine number, chassis number, and registration details.</p>

	<p>The PUC certificate indicates that your vehicle's emissions meet the specified standards. Obtain a self-attested PUC photocopy that is valid for at least the duration of the transport. Ensure the copy includes the vehicle's registration number, type of fuel, expiry date, and other relevant information.</p>

	<p>A valid insurance certificate is necessary to protect both you and the transporter against any potential damages or accidents. Ensure that the insurance certificate covers marine transit, as cars are transported by road across borders. Obtain a self-attested insurance certificate photocopy that includes the policy number, coverage details, and expiry date.</p>

	<p>The IBA-approved Consignment Bill of Lading is an essential document for car transport. It acts as a contract between you, the transporter, and the insurance company. This document includes details such as the vehicle make, model, color, and condition, as well as the delivery address and contact information.</p>

	<p>To ensure the maximum protection for your vehicle during the car transport process, you should opt for 100% declared-value marine transit insurance. This insurance covers your vehicle in case of damages, theft, or loss during transportation. Obtain a self-attested insurance policy document that clearly states the declared value of your vehicle.</p>

